--Description:  Compute the weighted GloVe vector for “polyamines”
-- Thinking process:
--   • Need element-wise division of the vector (a VARIANT array) by frequency^0.4.
--   • Direct array ÷ scalar fails, so use ARRAY_TRANSFORM to map a function across elements.  
